  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bc7a6fde2695e91b98.jpg\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bc7a6fde2695e91b98.jpg\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">האדם ועץ השדה - שיחה על שורשים, צמיחה ובדידות</span></h2><div><blockquote style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי הָאָדָם עֵץ הַשָּׂדֶה</span></blockquote><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span>הֵן הָאָדָם הָיָה כְּאַחַד מִמֶּנּוּ, </span><span>(1)</span><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יֹאמַר עֵץ הַשָּׂדֶה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲנָשִׁים אַחִים אֲנַחְנוּ,&nbsp;<span>(2)</span><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּמָה שֶׁלְּזֶה, יֵשׁ לָזֶה.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">רֹאשֵׁנוּ, בַּצַּמֶּרֶת נָטוּעַ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְלַאֲדָמָה אָנוּ אֲסוּרִים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְאִם שֶׁבָּרוּחַ נָנוּעַ,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(3)</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מְזוֹנֵנוּ בְּקַרְקַע עֲמָקִים.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּמוֹנִי כָּמוֹךָ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶפְרֶה וְאֶרְבֶּה.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּמוֹנִי כָּמוֹךָ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶת הָאֵשׁ יָרֵא.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּלְמִן הַיּוֹם שֶׁנִּטַּעְתִּי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָצָה לִי דַּרְכִּי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאַף כִּי בַּתְּחִלָּה צָמַחְתִּי,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נוֹתַרְתִּי זָקֵן בִּבְדִידוּתִי.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כִּתְמֵי עוֹרְךָ רַבּוּ,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(4)</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּמוֹ טַבְּעוֹת גִּזְעִי.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">פָּנֶיךָ, תְּלָמִים חָרְשׁוּ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מַסְגִּירִים אֶת גִּילִי.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֲרֻכִּים הָיוּ יָמֵינוּ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עוֹנוֹת פְּרִיחָה וְלִבְלוּב.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְיֵשׁ שֶׁהִשַּׁרְנוּ עָלֵינוּ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְנוֹתַרְנוּ עָרֹם וְעָלוּב.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בַּחֲלוֹף הַשָּׁנִים הִתְקָרַבְנוּ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נִדְבָּרִים, רַק בְּלִי מִלִּים.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בּוֹא וְשֵׁב בְּצִלֵּנוּ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נָשׂוּחַ שִׂיחַת דְּקָלִים.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(5)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבְתֹם חֲרוֹן הָאַף,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶרְאֶה בְּשׁוּב מַלְכִּי.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(6)</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">עֵצִים&nbsp;יִמְחֲאוּ כַּף,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(7)</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְכָעֵץ יַאֲרִיכוּ יְמֵי עַמִּי.&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: small;\">(8)</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">ביאורים</span></h3></div><div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בראשית ג-כב</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">בראשית יג-ח</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">הגם שיש לנו שאיפות</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">כאן העץ פונה אל האדם</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">חכמת שיחת האילנות (עפ\"י הגמרא)</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">שיבת ציון</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ישעיהו נה-יב</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">ישעיהו ס\"ה-כב</span></span></li></ol></div>"
}
